    "Ben-Duffy-1649": "<!-- Trimmed real capture of https://www.sherdog.com/authors/Ben-Duffy-1649\n     (fetched 2026-07-31; ads/scripts/related-article lists stripped, author-info\n     markup verbatim). -->\n<!DOCTYPE html><html><head>\n<title>MMA News and Articles by Ben Duffy - Sherdog.com</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sherdog senior editor Ben Duffy was born in Vietnam, grew up in Maryland, and lives in Houston, Texas. He has eclectic interests and a pathological compulsion to write about all of them.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"/image_crop/300/300/_images/authors/20260730103503_avsq2026.JPG\">\n</head><body>\n<div class=\"author-info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/image_crop/72/72/_images/authors/20260730103503_avsq2026.JPG\" class=\"profile_image\" alt=\"Author name\" />\n\n\t\t\t\t\tSherdog senior editor Ben Duffy was born in Vietnam, grew up in Maryland, and lives in Houston, Texas. He has eclectic interests and a pathological compulsion to write about all of them.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"socialmedia\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"twitter\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/#!/benjaminduffy\"  target=\"_blank\" ><img src=\"https://www2-cdn.sherdog.com/img/w/twitter.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Twitter\"><span class=\"twitter_id\">@benjaminduffy</span></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</body></html>\n",
